{"id":"diferencia","lemma":"diferencia","pos":"noun","rank":774,"glosses":["difference","difference (the result of a subtraction)"],"ipa":"/difeˈɾenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"diferencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-diferencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál es la diferencia?","en":"What's the difference?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38876"},{"text":"Dejamos nuestras diferencias en el pasado.","en":"We had our differences in the past."},{"text":"¿En qué se diferencia?","en":"What's the difference?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523346"},{"text":"Ellos no notaron las pequeñas diferencias.","en":"They did not notice the small differences."},{"text":"Tom marca la diferencia.","en":"Tom makes a difference.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302020"}]}